@startuml F1.8-D04-confirmar-wizard
title F1.8-D04 — Confirmar wizard (POST /requests)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "OpenRequestController" as Ctrl
participant "OpenRequestUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: Confirmar (passo 3)
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)

note right of UC
  Revalida form_schema
  numero_anual + prazo_em
  RN-F1.8-03 / 06
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT request\n+ workflow + outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: solicitação criada
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Aluno: /solicitacoes/:id

@enduml
